<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport"
          content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Country Explorer</title>
</head>

<body>

<header>

    <h1>🌍 Country Explorer</h1>

    <p>
        Discover interesting information about countries.
    </p>

</header>

<hr>

<main>

<section>

    <h2>🇯🇵 Japan</h2>

    <dl>

        <dt><strong>Capital</strong></dt>
        <dd>Tokyo</dd>

        <dt><strong>Continent</strong></dt>
        <dd>Asia</dd>

        <dt><strong>Currency</strong></dt>
        <dd>Japanese Yen</dd>

        <dt><strong>Language</strong></dt>
        <dd>Japanese</dd>

    </dl>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>🗺️ Quick Facts</h2>

    <table border="1" cellpadding="10">

        <tr>
            <th>Category</th>
            <th>Information</th>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Region</td>
            <td>East Asia</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Island Country</td>
            <td>Yes</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Time Zone</td>
            <td>JST</td>
        </tr>

    </table>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>🏯 Places to Explore</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Tokyo</li>
        <li>Kyoto</li>
        <li>Osaka</li>
        <li>Hokkaido</li>
    </ul>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>📖 Did You Know?</h2>

    <blockquote>
        Japan consists of thousands of islands and
        is known for its distinctive blend of traditional
        culture and modern technology.
    </blockquote>

</section>

</main>

<footer>

    <hr>

    <p>
        Country Explorer — Educational HTML Project
    </p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
